{% if render_mode == "full" %}
{# The tome they study (sever_spell_study), else their rank in each school (the skill the learning rule reads), and their
   history (sever_spell_history); both decorators ship with their DLL. Only while studying, for a real mage (40 in a
   school; a race's bonus alone gives 25), or for someone with a history here. #}
{% set study = sever_spell_study(actorUUID) %}
{% set history = sever_spell_history(actorUUID) %}
{% set alt = round(get_actor_value(actorUUID, "Alteration"), 0) %}
{% set con = round(get_actor_value(actorUUID, "Conjuration"), 0) %}
{% set des = round(get_actor_value(actorUUID, "Destruction"), 0) %}
{% set ill = round(get_actor_value(actorUUID, "Illusion"), 0) %}
{% set res = round(get_actor_value(actorUUID, "Restoration"), 0) %}
{% if study != "" or history != "" or alt >= 40 or con >= 40 or des >= 40 or ill >= 40 or res >= 40 %}
## Learning Magic

{% if study != "" %}
{{ study }}
{% else %}
Your skill in each school of magic: Alteration, {% if alt >= 100 %}master{% elif alt >= 75 %}expert{% elif alt >= 50 %}adept{% elif alt >= 25 %}apprentice{% elif alt >= 15 %}novice{% else %}untrained{% endif %}; Conjuration, {% if con >= 100 %}master{% elif con >= 75 %}expert{% elif con >= 50 %}adept{% elif con >= 25 %}apprentice{% elif con >= 15 %}novice{% else %}untrained{% endif %}; Destruction, {% if des >= 100 %}master{% elif des >= 75 %}expert{% elif des >= 50 %}adept{% elif des >= 25 %}apprentice{% elif des >= 15 %}novice{% else %}untrained{% endif %}; Illusion, {% if ill >= 100 %}master{% elif ill >= 75 %}expert{% elif ill >= 50 %}adept{% elif ill >= 25 %}apprentice{% elif ill >= 15 %}novice{% else %}untrained{% endif %}; Restoration, {% if res >= 100 %}master{% elif res >= 75 %}expert{% elif res >= 50 %}adept{% elif res >= 25 %}apprentice{% elif res >= 15 %}novice{% else %}untrained{% endif %}.
A spell one rank above your skill in its school is a stretch for you. Two ranks or more is far beyond you, and you know it: you can still try to learn it, from a teacher or a tome, but it often goes wrong, and a spell learned from that far beyond you can misfire until you have practised it or grown into it.
{% endif %}
{% if history != "" %}

What learning magic has left with you, newest first:
{{ history }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
